&lt;p style="margin-left:.25in; text-align:center"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:times new roman,times,serif"&gt;&lt;em&gt;This is a public meeting, subject to the public meeting law and it will be recorded. Deliberation of issues will only be conducted by Board members unless permitted by the Chair. Individuals who engage in disruptive behavior that impedes official business will be asked to stop being disruptive or leave the meeting. Additional measures may be taken to have disruptive individuals removed if their continued presence poses a safety risk to the other persons in the room or makes it impossible to continue the meeting.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

