     &lt;li&gt;&lt;span style="color:inherit; font-family:calibri,sans-serif; font-size:inherit"&gt;Why flu and COVID vaccination rates are declining and how that affects community health&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
     &lt;li&gt;&lt;span style="color:inherit; font-family:calibri,sans-serif; font-size:inherit"&gt;How flu vaccines reduce complications and severe outcomes (including ear infections in young children)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
     &lt;li&gt;&lt;span style="color:inherit; font-family:calibri,sans-serif; font-size:inherit"&gt;What families should know before traveling or gathering for the holidays&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
