&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;About Council for the Homeless&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;: Council for the Homeless (CFTH) is a nonprofit organization dedicated to preventing and ending homelessness in Clark County, Wash., by providing community leadership, compelling advocacy, and practical solutions to solve homelessness on an individual and community level. Founded in 1989, CFTH serves as the lead agency and coordinated entry for delivery of homeless services through the Continuum of Care for Homeless Services in Clark County, Wash.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

