     &lt;li&gt;Yerbinson Hernandez-Soto - Theft II&lt;/li&gt;
     &lt;li&gt;Harley Miller - Theft II&lt;/li&gt;
     &lt;li&gt;Rachelle Lusk - Theft II&lt;/li&gt;
     &lt;li&gt;Jason Bartoleme - Theft II&lt;/li&gt;
     &lt;li&gt;Tate Drebes - Theft II&lt;/li&gt;
     &lt;li&gt;Violetta Kakachiya - Theft II&lt;/li&gt;
     &lt;li&gt;a juvenile was referred to the District Attorney&rsquo;s office charged with Theft III&lt;/li&gt;
