&lt;p&gt;We&rsquo;d like to thank our partners at the Portland Police Bureau for their help with the December mission.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Members of the Commercial Crimes Unit (CCU) participate in retail theft missions throughout the year, to proactively address shoplifting, theft, robbery and other business crime. To learn more about their work, visit &lt;a href="http://www.tigard-or.gov/CCU"&gt;www.tigard-or.gov/CCU&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;

