&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:arial,sans-serif"&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;3:40 &ndash; 5 pm: General building tours and refreshments&lt;/p&gt;

