&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:arial,arial_embeddedfont,arial_msfontservice,sans-serif; font-size:12pt"&gt;The&amp;nbsp;Oregon Clinic&rsquo;s new&amp;nbsp;Foot and Ankle&amp;nbsp;office is located at&amp;nbsp;4212 NE Broadway, Suite 101, Portland 97203.&amp;nbsp;The clinic will&amp;nbsp;see&amp;nbsp;patients on&amp;nbsp;Tuesdays, Wednesdays, and Thursdays.&amp;nbsp;Patients&amp;nbsp;wishing to schedule an appointment at&amp;nbsp;either of TOC&rsquo;s Foot&amp;nbsp;&amp;amp; Ankle locations&amp;nbsp;can call&amp;nbsp;503-963-2964.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:arial,arial_embeddedfont,arial_msfontservice,sans-serif; font-size:12pt"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

