&lt;p&gt;The panel will use this time to review applications for the Strong Libraries LSTA Mini Grant. Questions or concerns can be addressed to Buzzy Nielsen (&lt;a href="mailto:buzzy.nielsen@slo.oregon.gov"&gt;buzzy.nielsen@slo.oregon.gov&lt;/a&gt;, 971-375-3486).&lt;/p&gt;

