&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:14px"&gt;Public comment will be limited to a total of&lt;u&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;30 minutes per meeting&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/u&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:14px"&gt;Individuals wishing to address the Board will be required to submit their request and topic&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong style="font-size:14px"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;em style="font-size:14px"&gt;&lt;u&gt;via the online form&amp;nbsp;at least 24 hours prior to the start of the regular business meeting&lt;/u&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:14px"&gt;For more information regarding this process, please visit our website&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:14px"&gt;at&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href="http://www.csd28j.org/" style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:rgb(34, 34, 34)"&gt;www.csd28j.org&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:14px"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

